     2328       end .
     2329       open QUERY br-gds-act FOR each tt-gds-act exclusive-lock .
     2330   END.
     2331   on choose of menu-item m-free in menu m-add
     2332   DO:
     2333       define variable v-user-action    as character no-undo.
